          "title": "Premiere night: the edge cache carries it",
          "description": "The premiere goes live and viewers triple in seconds. The CDN's route table sends 97% of segment requests to the edge cache; only misses reach the origin bucket, and playback starts ask the API for a manifest and a DRM licence.",
